#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:480
msgid "Put your bot to work"
msgstr "Ihren Bot einsetzen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:486
msgid "You have unsaved deployment changes. Leave this page anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Sie haben nicht gespeicherte Änderungen an der Bereitstellung. Diese Seite "
"trotzdem verlassen?"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:490
msgid "Deployment changes are not saved yet."
msgstr "Die Änderungen an der Bereitstellung wurden noch nicht gespeichert."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:491
#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:568
msgid "Save deployment"
msgstr "Bereitstellung speichern"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:494
msgid "Widget availability"
msgstr "Widget-Verfügbarkeit"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:495
msgid "Enable the widget"
msgstr "Widget aktivieren"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:495
msgid ""
"Turn this off to pause the WordPress embed without changing your DocsBot "
"bot."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivieren Sie diese Option, um die WordPress-Einbettung zu pausieren, "
"ohne Ihren DocsBot-Bot zu ändern."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:498
msgid "Only show on URL prefixes"
msgstr "Nur bei diesen URL-Präfixen anzeigen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:500
msgid ""
"One path prefix per line. These control placement, not authorization; use "
"the Audience controls below to protect access."
msgstr ""
"Ein Pfadpräfix pro Zeile. Diese Angaben steuern die Platzierung, nicht die "
"Zugriffsberechtigung. Verwenden Sie zum Schutz des Zugriffs die Zielgruppen-"
"Einstellungen unten."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:503
msgid "Never show on URL prefixes"
msgstr "Bei diesen URL-Präfixen niemals anzeigen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:505
msgid "Exclusions always win over inclusions."
msgstr "Ausschlüsse haben immer Vorrang vor Einschlüssen."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:509
msgid "Allowed embed domains"
msgstr "Zulässige Einbettungsdomains"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:511
msgid ""
"One hostname per line, without a scheme or wildcard. Saved to DocsBot as "
"defense in depth."
msgstr ""
"Ein Hostname pro Zeile, ohne Schema oder Platzhalter. Wird als zusätzliche "
"Schutzmaßnahme in DocsBot gespeichert."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:516
msgid "Audience"
msgstr "Zielgruppe"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:517
msgid "Only show to logged-in WordPress users"
msgstr "Nur angemeldeten WordPress-Benutzern anzeigen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:519
msgid "Allowed WordPress roles"
msgstr "Zulässige WordPress-Rollen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:520
msgid "Leave every role unchecked to allow all roles."
msgstr "Lassen Sie alle Rollen deaktiviert, um sämtliche Rollen zuzulassen."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:528
msgid "Membership integration"
msgstr "Mitgliedschaftsintegration"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:530
msgid "Plan, product, or role IDs"
msgstr "Tarif-, Produkt- oder Rollen-IDs"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:532
msgid ""
"Comma-separated. Leave empty for any active membership; Ultimate Member "
"requires role slugs."
msgstr ""
"Kommagetrennt. Für jede aktive Mitgliedschaft leer lassen; Ultimate Member "
"erfordert Rollen-Slugs."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:536
msgid ""
"The selected membership integration is not currently available. The widget "
"will fail closed until it is active."
msgstr ""
"Die ausgewählte Mitgliedschaftsintegration ist derzeit nicht verfügbar. Das "
"Widget verweigert den Zugriff, bis die Integration wieder aktiv ist."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:541
msgid "Conversation identity"
msgstr "Unterhaltungsidentität"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:542
msgid ""
"Sharing identity makes DocsBot conversations non-anonymous. Each field is "
"optional and is sent only after the visitor passes your access rules."
msgstr ""
"Durch das Teilen der Identität sind DocsBot-Unterhaltungen nicht mehr "
"anonym. Jedes Feld ist optional und wird erst gesendet, nachdem der Besucher"
" Ihre Zugriffsregeln erfüllt hat."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:544
msgid "Share display name"
msgstr "Anzeigenamen teilen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:545
msgid "Share email address"
msgstr "E-Mail-Adresse teilen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:546
msgid "Share pseudonymous site user ID"
msgstr "Pseudonyme Website-Benutzer-ID teilen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:548
msgid ""
"Review the suggested DocsBot text under Settings → Privacy before enabling "
"identity fields."
msgstr ""
"Prüfen Sie den vorgeschlagenen DocsBot-Text unter Einstellungen → "
"Datenschutz, bevor Sie Identitätsfelder aktivieren."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:552
msgid "Private bot signing"
msgstr "Signierung privater Bots"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:555
msgid "Private signing is ready"
msgstr "Private Signierung ist eingerichtet"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:555
msgid ""
"The bot signing key was retrieved securely and encrypted on this WordPress "
"server. Visitors receive only short-lived signed tokens."
msgstr ""
"Der Bot-Signaturschlüssel wurde sicher abgerufen und auf diesem WordPress-"
"Server verschlüsselt. Besucher erhalten ausschließlich kurzlebige signierte "
"Tokens."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:557
msgid "Signing key unavailable"
msgstr "Signaturschlüssel nicht verfügbar"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:557
msgid ""
"Reconnect this bot to retrieve its signing key. DocsBot will keep the widget"
" paused until private signing is ready."
msgstr ""
"Verbinden Sie diesen Bot erneut, um seinen Signaturschlüssel abzurufen. "
"DocsBot lässt das Widget pausiert, bis die private Signierung eingerichtet "
"ist."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:560
msgid "Token lifetime (seconds)"
msgstr "Token-Gültigkeitsdauer (Sekunden)"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:564
msgid "The selected bot is public, so no signature key is needed or retained."
msgstr ""
"Der ausgewählte Bot ist öffentlich, daher wird kein Signaturschlüssel "
"benötigt oder gespeichert."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:566
msgid "Open bot embed settings in DocsBot"
msgstr "Bot-Einbettungseinstellungen in DocsBot öffnen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:584
msgid "The connection is managed through wp-config.php."
msgstr "Die Verbindung wird über die wp-config.php verwaltet."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:602
msgid "DocsBot has been disconnected."
msgstr "Die Verbindung zu DocsBot wurde getrennt."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:607
msgid "Enter an API key to connect DocsBot."
msgstr "Geben Sie einen API-Schlüssel ein, um DocsBot zu verbinden."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:634
msgid "DocsBot connected. Now choose a team and bot."
msgstr "DocsBot ist verbunden. Wählen Sie jetzt ein Team und einen Bot aus."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:656
msgid "Select a valid DocsBot team."
msgstr "Wählen Sie ein gültiges DocsBot-Team aus."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:684
msgid "Team selected. Create a bot in DocsBot to continue."
msgstr "Team ausgewählt. Erstellen Sie einen Bot in DocsBot, um fortzufahren."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:684
